comments.body:
I'm not sure this is a bug. I think this was implemented intentionally. All extensions that we have in core and contrib do not depend on each other. This assumption is used in some discussions around config grouping/merging, e.g.: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/issues/18509 and https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/8394.

I think we need a strong argument to introduce this behavior.

@reporter do you have an extension that depends on another extension? Can you please let us know why it's needed in your use case?
